cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pid-rs in academic work, cite this software release and the underlying estimator paper(s). API stability does not imply estimator validity outside the documented assumptions."
title: "pid-rs: Partial Information Decomposition and continuous mutual-information estimators in Rust"
abstract: "A safe-Rust implementation of empirical categorical shared-exclusions partial information decomposition and conditional KSG mutual-information estimation, with default-off experimental continuous I^sx/PID research surfaces, diagnostics, preprocessing, and reproducible run-logs."
type: software
